# Friendly fire makes every teammate hostile, and the player's own combat volume raises the combat state and its music
# for any hostile body inside, so two players standing together heard battle until they parted. Teammates are kept out
# of that volume, so the music stays calm on both machines. Hero 5 slot 0.

include session.coop
A expect teammate contains "dist=" timeout=30
A expect combatmusic == 0 timeout=10
B expect combatmusic == 0 timeout=10

A ff on
B expect state contains "ff=on" timeout=10
include ff_place.part
sleep 4
A expect combatmusic == 0 timeout=1
B expect combatmusic == 0 timeout=1
A shot
B shot
